    {
      "id": "haven",
      "name": "Haven",
      "size_m": 1000.0,
      "source": {
        "url": "https://www.inven.co.kr/board/battlegrounds/5074/3400",
        "license": "MIT for LootLizard's factual coordinate annotations; original map artwork is not licensed by this import",
        "attribution": "Original map: 핑핑위 / Nabae-_- / HwapYong (Inven); coordinate transcription: LootLizard contributors",
        "notes": "22 independently transcribed possible Pillar Supply Cache building centres from an original community post dated 2020-12-10 with a map image revised 2021-03-25. The source reports only five active caches per match among possible buildings; activation/current-game validity is not verified. These are historical candidate BUILDING centres, not exact doors or guaranteed active caches. Marker centres were georegistered onto the bundled official 819x819 reference using 406 affine inliers (517 matches; median geometric residual 0.235 reference px, p95 1.161 px). These residuals describe image alignment, not entrance-location accuracy. Coordinates are normalized on the full reference, top-left origin, x right/east, y down/south. Native marked map uses a separate image size and affine transform, not an 8192-pixel divisor. No original map artwork or text is redistributed. Exact observed marker centres, transform, source URLs and uncertainty are recorded in data-sources/haven-candidate-buildings.json. Reviewed 2026-10-22; not verified in-game for LootLizard."
      },
